	//
	// A is row‑major; we again traverse row-by-row (i outer, j inner).
	// We:
	//   - Create a view x_j where x_j[j] == x[j], so its logical index
	//     matches A's 'j' dimension.
	//   - For each row i, accumulate w[i] in a local variable w_i to avoid
	//     repeatedly loading/storing w[i] inside the inner loop.
	// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
